---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact YourBrokerPal" description="Contact YourBrokerPal about DSCR financing for your investment property.">
<div class="page"><div class="kicker">CONTACT</div><h1>Let's talk about your investment property.</h1><p class="lead">Have a purchase or refinance in mind? Send a note with a few details and we'll follow up about possible next steps.</p><div class="contact-card"><div><small>EMAIL</small><a href="mailto:brian@yourbrokerpal.com">brian@yourbrokerpal.com</a></div><div><small>WHAT TO INCLUDE</small><p>Property city and state, purchase or refinance, estimated loan amount, and the best way to reach you.</p></div><a class="button" href="mailto:brian@yourbrokerpal.com?subject=YourBrokerPal%20DSCR%20Financing%20Inquiry">Email YourBrokerPal ↗</a></div><p class="fine">For your protection, please do not send Social Security numbers, bank statements, tax returns, or other sensitive personal or financial documents by regular email.</p></div>
</Layout>
<style>.page{max-width:800px;margin:auto;padding:35px 0 70px}.kicker{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#a47a3e;font-weight:800}.page h1{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,56px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2px;color:#10243c;margin:20px 0}.lead{font-size:18px;color:#617387;line-height:1.8}.contact-card{margin-top:35px;background:#f0f3f5;padding:30px;display:grid;gap:25px}.contact-card small{display:block;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#a47a3e;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:7px}.contact-card a:not(.button){font-size:20px;color:#10243c;font-weight:800}.contact-card p{color:#596d81;margin:0}.button{display:inline-block;background:#c59a58;color:#10243c;text-decoration:none;font-weight:800;padding:13px 19px;width:max-content}.fine{font-size:13px;color:#778696;margin-top:20px}</style>